      "value": "This was previously a humorous post about me roasting myself, but people like to screenshot things out of context, so I'm changing it! Not like it'll matter.\n\nAnyways, polygon count DOES affect performance. Either way we bumped it to 70k after doing a bit of research. So that should be enough.",
      "viewerReactions": null
